title: ai-usage-exporter
abstract: >-
  A cross-platform Go exporter that scans local AI coding agent logs
  (Claude Code, Codex CLI, OpenCode, and others) and exposes token, model,
  session, and cost metrics on a Prometheus /metrics endpoint.
type: software
authors:
